00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:13.140
last year's best human team using Opus 4.1. The physical robot still failed to fetch a beach ball.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:19.380
The work explores how frontier models handle real-world robotics code under realistic constraints.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:25.740
Teams building physical or simulated agents should review the accompanying frontier red team blog

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:32.260
